              "@type": "Person",
              "name": "pindy4176"
            },
            "reviewBody": "I wanted to try a watermelon salad, and picked this recipe because I had all the ingredients on hand. I was nervous about Worcestershire sauce in the dressing, but the salad was fantastic! The flavors blended beautifully, and the salad is colorful, too. I provided feta and goat cheeses to garnish. This was a big hit, and I will definitely make it again!",
